  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A mass <em>m</em> undergoes simple harmonic motion with amplitude <em>A</em>, angular speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span> and total energy <em>E</em>. The amplitude is changed to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{A}{4}\"></span> and the total energy is changed to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E}{2}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the new mass and the new angular speed?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Mass</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Angular speed</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><em>m</em></td>\n<td>8<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><em>2m</em></td>\n<td>2<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><em>m</em></td>\n<td>4<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><em>4m</em></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
  },
